content.p:
 The protection and upkeep measures ordered constitute public-law restrictions on the use of property (Art. 702 Civil Code

 SR 210
	). They are binding on the landowner concerned and must be recorded in the land register on application by the canton. Exemptions from this obligation are determined by the Federal Council.

item.p:
destroys or seriously damages buried natural objects or antiquities of substantial scientific value

 Revised by the Drafting Committee of the Federal Assembly (Art. 58 para. 1 ParlA; SR 171.10).
	 (Art. 724 para. 1 Civil Code

 SR 210
	);
